ce":"袁盎","kind":"person","person_id":"j32_wtj_khz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m012-0196","start":196,"end":198,"surface":"竇嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"2uk_ay7_hjf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m012-0214","start":214,"end":224,"surface":"諸陵長者長安中賢大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、學說合稱、典故或待辨匿名指代，未補成員及姓名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao","book_id":"b-shiji-101","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-101-yuanchao"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p013","text":"及鼂錯已誅，袁盎以太常使吳。吳王欲使將，不肯。欲殺之，使一都尉以五百人圍守盎軍中。袁盎自其為吳相時，（嘗）有從史嘗盜愛盎侍兒，盎知之，弗泄，遇之如故。人有告從史，言「君知爾與侍者通」，乃亡歸。袁盎驅自追之，遂以侍者賜之，復為從史。及袁盎使吳見守，從史適為守盎校尉司馬，乃悉以其裝齎置二石醇醪，會天寒，士卒饑渴，飲酒醉，西南陬卒皆臥，司馬夜引袁盎起，曰：「君可以去矣，吳王期旦日斬君。」盎弗信，曰：「公何為者？」司馬曰：「臣故為從史盜君侍兒者。」盎乃驚謝曰；「公幸有親，吾不足以累公。」司馬曰：「君弟去，臣亦且亡，辟吾親，君何患！」乃以刀決張，道從醉卒（直）隧［直］出。司馬與分背，袁盎解節毛懷之，杖，步行七八里，明，見梁騎，騎馳去，遂歸報。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m013-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"鼂錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m013-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"袁盎","kind":"person","person_id":"j32_wtj_khz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m013-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"7l9_yz7_nwv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m013-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"都尉","kind":"person","person_id":"ro0_0hy_dw9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m013-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"盎","kind":"person","person_id":"j32_wtj_khz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m013-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"袁盎","kind":"person","person_id":"j32_wtj_khz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m013-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"從史","kind":"person","person