face":"袁盎","kind":"person","person_id":"j32_wtj_khz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m013-0309","start":309,"end":311,"surface":"梁騎","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、學說合稱、典故或待辨匿名指代，未補成員及姓名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao","book_id":"b-shiji-101","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-101-yuanchao"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p020","text":"鼂錯已死，謁者仆射鄧公為校尉，擊吳楚軍為將。還，上書言軍事，謁見上。上問曰：「道軍所來，聞鼂錯死，吳楚罷不？」鄧公曰：「吳王為反數十年矣，發怒削地，以誅錯為名，其意非在錯也。且臣恐天下之士噤口，不敢復言也！」上曰：「何哉？」鄧公曰：「夫鼂錯患諸侯彊大不可制，故請削地以尊京師，萬世之利也。計畫始行，卒受大戮，內杜忠臣之口，外為諸侯報仇，臣竊為陛下不取也。」於是景帝默然良久，曰：「公言善，吾亦恨之。」乃拜鄧公為城陽中尉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m020-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"鼂錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m020-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"鄧公","kind":"person","person_id":"ktk_wbg_wnm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m020-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"etc_iw9_5so","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m020-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"鼂錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m020-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"鄧公","kind":"person","person_id":"ktk_wbg_wnm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m020-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"7l9_yz7_nwv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m020-0076","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m020-0084","start":84,"end":85,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m020-0104","start":104,"end":105,"sur